Day 48 – Compare & Decide Builder
Overview

Today's project focuses on designing a Compare & Decide Builder, a decision-support application that helps users compare multiple options using real-world evaluation criteria and transparent research.

Features
Guided MCQ-based decision setup
Multi-criteria comparison system
Adjustable weighting for personalized rankings
Live score calculation
Source and citation panel
Research methodology section
Responsive and modern interface
Graceful handling of loading, empty, and edge states
